Package: tunproxy
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, curl, ca-certificates, sudo
Description: Minimal transparent TUN proxy controller
 TunProxy manages a pinned private sing-box core and forwards Linux traffic to
 a user-configured SOCKS5 upstream without shell proxy environment variables.
